<Layout title="About" description="Learn about Easy Home Workout's mission to make home fitness accessible and clear."><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">About Easy Home Workout</span><h1>A welcoming place to begin moving.</h1><p>Easy Home Workout is a home fitness and education platform for people who want clear guidance and an approachable starting point.</p></div></section><section class="content-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our story</span><h2>Fitness can feel confusing when you're just starting.</h2><p>We created Easy Home Workout for people who want to exercise at home but aren't sure which movements to try, how to make a plan, or how to keep going. Our aim is to make the first steps feel more understandable and manageable.</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="icon">&middot;</div><h3>Our mission</h3><p>To make fitness education and home workouts accessible, simple, and understandable for everyone.</p><h3>Our vision</h3><p>To encourage healthier lifestyles through consistent physical activity and better fitness knowledge.</p></div></div><div style="margin-top:58px"><span class="eyebrow">What we stand for</span><h2>Principles that keep us grounded.</h2><div class="grid-4"><article class="card feature-card"><div class="icon">&#8599;</div><h3>Fitness for everyone</h3><p>Movement is for all bodies and starting points.</p></article><article class="card feature-card"><div class="icon">&#8599;</div><h3>Simplicity over complexity</h3><p>Clear instructions help people take the next step.</p></article><article class="card feature-card"><div class="icon">&#8599;</div><h3>Consistency over perfection</h3><p>Small repeatable actions can build a routine.</p></article><article class="card feature-card"><div class="icon">&#8599;</div><h3>Healthy living and balance</h3><p>Fitness belongs alongside rest and everyday life.</p></article></div></div></div></section></Layout>


